<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes have expanded from the Northwest and Southwest to the major cities of Yaounde, Douala and Maroua as Cameroonian security forces confront Ambazonian separatists. Separatist attacks continue in the Anglophone regions ten years after the crisis began, while UNESCO has joined national efforts to prevent femicide in Cameroon. The Cameroon Senate President publicly denied social media rumours of an assassination attempt against him. Metal Shark is constructing patrol boats for Cameroon, indicating a focus on maritime security. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPLW93ZFRQNG1CektwTG1UVEVMdDRRbmRQNVUwWlQyUHFkVVpRVHhwZ19DQlZRZW1JT3dhbllFZi1fMXA5a1FxSVc0U25XOENXNy1KOUI2T05iWHBXY2V6MkFCWGVOaU5nT3I4eklpTVd5cXlyRGRUQ3BZQllzV01XZW1jRU5LWGtHUTgwd3Q4QTNVNVV4dEc2SGdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQa25iTnJIcXVwQzVaMk1nRW9wZGRvdWlqTkpZOERVWDgyVWMxbHBqUm1uSGJ0QUxvZlJ4b1VNZlh4SjJpWUFSYS1HQ1pSMFVPdFpwWnFkZmN6OXk4dHhkZnVDbEs2Q2ZLMkxtaDVoX3dycHJrTnVGNDNoWlFTdHRBSmhKUTZRRi1MeEoxVnhSTFcyWGV5aVU5RkxUR181SHZoZ2RwMFdmZ2hMc3hESzEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOcl9BQm5DR0ZNWlUxc2xpbXRMcThkdDhqcDBTa1J0MllGVGFiWmJLZGpsYjNaeWN0VzBkTURCRWhzeF80TU9Wdm9GZVpwb0ozRGF4RzF1TjJVUUV3d3ZUMHVEakJaV0h5cVdCQmlBbzBGODYyb3EwMzc4eDF3REswUEhpWFcyUG90YkpQTEJUMmk3WDFOWDBITGo5YXg4b1ZlcUM0cGgyQ2xEMjg3NjhidWdjU0NtTGNaZEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;FRCN HQ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;7NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOWVRobkdDTTZheUZ5Qm